      {
        "id": "507651",
        "date_added": "2026-10-13 15:21:08",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Note on the SalatStealer tag: this file is the .NET launcher HiddenAutoLauncher and contains no Salat Stealer code. It copies itself to %APPDATA%\\SystemData\\svchost.exe, sets the Run value SystemAutoLauncher, waits 60 minutes and runs its resource svchost.svchost.exe (14a0b7d57f22378472a4e1d20fc50d38db5dab72d46007b472d466049181ab0b), a loader that replaces steam.exe with a fake Steam client (1d52f76213582b58cd3d0161dee345f42184b05a359607e4719f96c511e7fd3c) loading https://8909451279.f1shh.at/. It does travel with Salat Stealer: the SilentExecuter .NET binders 0a4048ebe7a683ffef1cae2902477b713980fe4142ee703be02c7544ebbf66b4, 43bd6a55a0829f571e68891b27b8267d4d1cba419d5ee2da3b153374ab4b105a and fe8174a3605239522f774af91f04b4a9f62cbbff4f72e0756a932e97d9ac3131 each drop this file as conhost.exe next to a UPX-packed Salat build as svchost.exe. Static analysis only."
      }
